close_reason: "Claim refusals and pm next report claim age and idleness, and an idle claim can be taken over under the stale-work policy with audited history"
contract_change:
  api: "pm claim --takeover-stale (claim --start, start-task, MCP and SDK takeoverStale); already_claimed_by refusal context; NextResult.held_by_others (NextHeldRow); ClaimResult.takeover; strict tool-parameters schema 4.28.0"
  before: "already_claimed_by carried claimed_by, claimed_at and claim_source only; held_by_others rows were {id, assignee}; --force was the only way past another holder, active or abandoned"
  after: "already_claimed_by and the new stale_claim_takeover_refused carry claim_activity {last_activity_at, claim_age_hours, idle_hours, stale_policy}; held_by_others rows add claimed_at, idle_hours and stale; --takeover-stale takes over only a claim idle for mutation_guard.stale_in_progress_hours (default 72), refuses an active one without writing, and records context.stale_claim_takeover in the claim history entry"
  migrate: "Code that constructs NextResult or held_by_others rows supplies claimed_at, idle_hours and stale; consumers pinning the tool-parameters schema version accept 4.28.0; take over abandoned claims with --takeover-stale instead of --force"
escape_class: production_defect
