  negative_control: "node scripts/run-tests.mjs test tests/unit/commands/lifecycle/claim-stale-takeover.spec.ts tests/unit/sdk/lifecycle/claim-ownership-activity.spec.ts (before the fix --takeover-stale is an unknown option, the refusal has no claim_activity, held_by_others rows have no idle evidence and an active claim can only be refused or forced)"
